<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Oct industrial production falls 1.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish Oct industrial production falls 1.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial production fell 1.3 percent in October from September but was unchanged year on year, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>  (Percentage change)	   Oct 96   Sept 96     yr/yr</p>
<p> SWEDISH INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     -1.3	+1.0	 0.0</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
